Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.57,0:00:09.78,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,É hora do Quiz de Curiosidades Uma!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.18,0:00:14.58,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Neste quiz, nossas participantes irão competir em quem\Nconhece mais sobre a presidente do conselho estudantil!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:17.75,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,E quem ganhar vai poder correr contra ela!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.11,0:00:19.62,Black,Contestants,0,0,0,,Woo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.61,0:00:22.02,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Vamos começar com as perguntas!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.34,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Como a kaichou, Symboli Rudolf, é conhecida?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:27.38,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,A "Imperador"!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:28.42,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Correto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:29.38,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,Isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:33.05,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,E o que ela sempre aprendeu desde criança?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.25,0:00:39.23,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Liderança... é o que eu diria, mas isso seria uma resposta muito simples.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.46,0:00:41.77,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,{\t(1289,1414,1,\c&HD9D9D9&)}São trocadilhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.77,0:00:42.80,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,O-o quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.50,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,LIderança.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.50,0:00:46.42,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Correto!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:47.44,Black,Symboli Kris S,0,0,0,,É claro.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:48.89,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Próxima pergunta!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.89,0:00:53.01,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,A kaichou sempre consegue acalmar os nervos das estudantes. O que ela usa—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:55.31,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Dessa vez são os trocadilhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.94,0:00:57.17,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,O qu-! Como?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:00:58.79,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Eu ainda estava lendo a pergunta!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.79,0:01:01.27,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,—usa como hobby em seu tempo vago?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:02.79,Black,Tsurumaru Tsuyoshi,0,0,0,,Para que serviu a primeira parte da pergunta?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.89,0:01:05.06,Black,Air Groove,0,0,0,,Xadrez.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.06,0:01:06.13,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Correto!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.62,0:01:08.88,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Por favor observem isto para a próxima pergunta!
