Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.32,0:01:13.64,Black,Symboli Rudolf,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,840)}Deixa eu ver...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.62,0:01:16.96,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,O que a kaichou está pensando?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.96,0:01:18.72,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Usem suas lousas para responder!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.46,0:01:23.52,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Vamos ver as respostas!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.96,0:01:26.32,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Estou apostando tudo nisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.17,0:01:30.61,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Uau! A Sirius não está deixando passar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:31.70,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Mas será que ela está correta desta vez?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.38,0:01:33.32,Black,Symboli Rudolf,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,840)}A escola...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:38.06,Black,Symboli Rudolf,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,840)}...eu não consigo pensar em piadas com ela.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:40.66,Black,Symboli Rudolf,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,840)}...Oh, já sei! A cafeteria da escola é--
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:44.21,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,A resposta é "trocadilhos"!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.66,0:01:45.61,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Isso!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.61,0:01:47.82,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Q-quero dizer, obviamente.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.82,0:01:49.67,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Vamos continuar com as perguntas!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.67,0:01:49.71,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 913.6 1054.59 b 928.77 1022.98 956.46 978.56 1032.97 916.85 l 228 584 188 1057.33)}Vamos continuar com as perguntas!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.71,0:01:49.76,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,{\clip(m 607.38 1059.69 b 609.87 1015.77 602.81 996.24 595.41 971.38 l 596.58 957.19 702 1063.88)}Vamos continuar com as perguntas!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.16,0:01:53.24,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Certo, errado, certo, errado!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:54.61,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Correto!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.37,0:01:57.05,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Que pena!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.48,0:02:00.14,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,{\t(2097,2681,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&)}Hora do castigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:03.35,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Hora de anunciar os resultados!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.79,0:02:12.03,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Aquela que conquistou mais perguntas, \Nque terá a honra de correr com a kaichou é....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.50,0:02:13.86,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Eu!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:19.21,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Eu acertei todas as perguntas!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:20.16,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,É por isso que...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:22.51,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Até mais!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.51,0:02:23.58,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Vamos lá, kaichou!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.03,0:02:25.17,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,Pfffft!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.63,Black,Sirius Symboli,0,0,0,,Espera só, sua...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.63,0:02:29.21,Black,Tokai Teio,0,0,0,,{\t(768,1602,1,\c&H000000&)}Não quero!
